<description>&lt;p&gt;U.S. soldiers are now operating alongside Ecuadorian forces against cartels, and MQ-9 Reaper drones have been redeployed from Africa to Colombia and Ecuador for drug-cartel operations. A fishing vessel off Ecuador's coast was attacked, killing multiple people and extending violence to the maritime domain. Workers at a mining company linked to a wealthy Australian individual report threats and intimidation from unknown actors. Two battle-related deaths were recorded in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxPajZUbGM0RmUtdjZzdzRFSmhBQ3dsc3k2bXlwYndqd2FJc2JDZjhBMFE5di1FUFR1NTRRLTZiZzZsM0tsN1BJQ3JzV01LbFdDbWduMnNENDB5QmZkODRzbWVxTWF3cF9ucU5vZmpjbjJULWltMWpIVWxBTzFWRWlxeQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxNeEFWMGlqekJFZ3lFYm5GeEhnRzdWQ2ZVa2tPS1lob3ZKaXlMS1FMMjRZUmx0aDBNbkdIR1pvTktJZTAwQ0FBdU85VWd6aXRqb0k0ZHZ3UnlubGNJT1lVY1lleU1RNk1FWHJGSlhrcnZFbVhkSXFNdDlmR1RQcHVsbEo3VG9VVVFHTXIwUGhpRGdhTkRxS2FCY192TWhnRy1vNVRMd0h3?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTFBrV3B1NktrWVpmUHkyX19mR0ZETGxGR2FFRjlnLTBCdWtua0h6WXVNRUI1bDVtQlJYYzFzVFZwX1llSzYwcS1xTjlucU5iT3NvUVNOV2FXalQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxPZVdTY2w0aFhkeDdIaGVVLVVhdHV1czJOcFJGNTVwbnZueE1tTjNiMFViZEFTRFVKZDY5MGdSaDJXTzVaNjZpX3UzWWZNeEI4bTdlMHVBd2haZnA2ZG9iYWlDd3NVVk5VcnpRNEVyWktQRU5IX0hjdkFXR3JiblpxMDNMcVU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mirage News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxORzJEVllqSXVPM3hWMlVFakdwMDNGYkxIeW9sWXFxS1V4WlQwbC1MbTU3ZEEyRE1MYWpXbnFEMTZJTnl2YXlraEJHNFZOSlFEajEtVXY0d3BqNU1ZUXA4bVZTUktqYTJwNzdSZ2NERU0tTmtxQzE5bjRYZ051UWM4YlM0dmEyc3lYR0ZweFlSd0syR0ZNZmRXeVdETVp6N2VTZDh